{
  "Description": "CR-26 (Azure roles held by guest accounts) fixtures, synthetic names and IDs, the real built-in role definition IDs. Guests is IA.17-GUESTS, Rbac IA.17-RBAC and Entra IA.17-ENTRA as collector 1.21.0 writes them, and EmergencyAccess the IA.16-ACCOUNTS and IA.16-GROUPS rows of a complete read. Vendor Support holds Contributor on a resource group and Reader at the root scope, directly, and the Microsoft Entra role Directory Readers. Partner Analyst reaches Contributor as a member of ext-tier2, nested in ext-vendors, and has not accepted its invitation. Audit Reviewer reaches Reader only through the dynamic group ext-guests-dynamic. Data Consultant holds Storage Blob Data Reader on a storage account with a condition, and its UPN starts with = as a spreadsheet formula would. Kept Contractor holds Owner on a subscription. Atmosera SOC (Atmosera in its UPN) and Night Shift Analyst (in the Atmosera group SOC-Atmosera-Responders) are emergency access guests and stay out. Decisions is the file the client returns: Remove for Vendor Support, Audit Reviewer and an object ID no longer a guest, remove in lower case for Partner Analyst, Keep for Kept Contractor and no answer for Data Consultant.",
